{
  "_comment": [
    "The profile for one content type. News, blogs and events are separate",
    "migrations that happen to share code: each has its own folder hierarchy in",
    "Storyblok and its own components, so anything that differs between them",
    "belongs in a file like this rather than in an if-statement in the pipeline.",
    "",
    "Copy this file to add a type, change what differs, leave the rest."
  ],
  "type": "news",
  "label": "news story",
  "folder": "News-Pipeline",
  "source": "news.json",
  "assets_dir": "News",
  "hierarchy": {
    "_comment": [
      "Where a story lands. `leaf` is the folder that actually holds the item;",
      "the patterns are chosen by placement, which the taxonomy computes.",
      "Blogs and events can differ here -- a different leaf, or fewer levels."
    ],
    "leaf": "news",
    "global_root": "global",
    "regions_root": "regions",
    "patterns": {
      "global": "global/{leaf}",
      "region": "regions/{region}/{leaf}",
      "entity": "regions/{region}/entities/{entity}/{leaf}",
      "entity-department": "regions/{region}/entities/{entity}/departments/{department}/{leaf}"
    }
  },
  "source_urls": {
    "_comment": [
      "CONFIRM: where this type lives on aku.edu -- the SOURCE, not the target.",
      "",
      "These two are easy to conflate and are not the same thing. `hierarchy.leaf`",
      "is where an item lands in Storyblok. This is where it came from: the path",
      "SharePoint serves it under, the detail page its internal links point at, and",
      "the shape of the id in those links (news_details.aspx?nid=NEWS-1234).",
      "",
      "They coincide for news, which is exactly why the /news in build_link_map.py",
      "went unnoticed. For blogs and events the values below are a GUESS -- check a",
      "real internal link in the export before the first run, or every cross-link",
      "will simply fail to resolve and be left pointing at aku.edu."
    ],
    "prefix": "/news",
    "detail_page": "News_Details.aspx",
    "id_prefix": "NEWS"
  },
  "storyblok": {
    "_comment": [
      "The component this type becomes, and which bloks its body may contain.",
      "Read off the live space; a type whose schema differs gets its own values",
      "here rather than a fork of build_payload."
    ],
    "component": "news_article",
    "body_whitelist": [
      "rich_text",
      "box",
      "video",
      "media_section",
      "quote_banner",
      "button",
      "media_card",
      "row",
      "split_section",
      "brand_banner",
      "brand_logo",
      "iframe",
      "image"
    ],
    "background_pattern_asset_id": 202607823391189,
    "quote_background_asset_id": 202908142091464
  },
  "layout": {
    "_comment": [
      "How source content maps onto components. Signed off against the",
      "reference story; see docs/PROJECT.md section 5.",
      "",
      "spacing is mandatory on every blok -- three values, by component. A blok",
      "without one renders with no vertical rhythm at all."
    ],
    "description_from": "first_paragraph",
    "description_min_chars": 40,
    "description_min_words": 6,
    "single_image": "inline_richtext",
    "image_run_threshold": 2,
    "gallery_position": "in_place",
    "unplaced_gallery_position": "end",
    "quote": "quote_banner",
    "quote_with_image": "split_section",
    "embed": "iframe",
    "youtube": "media_section_video",
    "hosted_video": "media_section_video",
    "tables": "skip",
    "spacing": {
      "text": {
        "mobile_x": 20,
        "desktop_x": 176
      },
      "full": {
        "mobile_x": null,
        "desktop_x": null
      },
      "mid": {
        "mobile_x": 20,
        "desktop_x": 80
      },
      "margin_bottom": {
        "mobile": 24,
        "desktop": 56
      },
      "by_component": {
        "rich_text": "text",
        "quote_banner": "full",
        "brand_banner": "full",
        "media_section_video": "full",
        "media_section_gallery": "mid",
        "split_section": "mid",
        "iframe": "mid",
        "image": "mid",
        "button": "mid"
      }
    }
  },
  "fields": {
    "_comment": [
      "Source column names. A different SharePoint list may name these",
      "differently; map them here rather than editing the export."
    ],
    "id": "Id",
    "title": "Title",
    "body": "NewsContent",
    "sequence_number": "SequenceNumber",
    "city": "City",
    "entity": "Entity",
    "additional_entity": "AdditionalEntity",
    "tags": "Tags",
    "approver_group": "LocalApproverGroup",
    "date": "ScheduleStartDate",
    "summary": "NewsSummary",
    "author": "ContentWriter",
    "pull_quote": "PullQuote",
    "pull_quote_author": "PullQuoteAuthor",
    "language_links": [
      "NewsInUrdu",
      "SecondaryLanguage2",
      "SecondaryLanguage3"
    ]
  },
  "_content_fields_comment": [
    "The story payload, declared rather than coded. build_storyblok_stories.py",
    "walks this list in order, so the emitted JSON key order is this order --",
    "which is why it was generated from the previous hardcoded version rather",
    "than retyped.",
    "",
    "  field:    a logical name from `fields` above, resolved per content type",
    "  column:   a raw export column, for anything only this list has",
    "  computed: built by the pipeline (title, uid, pull_quote, ...)",
    "  decode:   taxonomy | ref | tags | entity_list | urdu_link",
    "",
    "The 27 `column` entries are News-list specific. A different list simply",
    "declares its own, and pipeline/ needs no change."
  ],
  "content_fields": [
    {
      "key": "component",
      "computed": "component"
    },
    {
      "key": "_uid",
      "computed": "uid"
    },
    {
      "key": "title",
      "computed": "title"
    },
    {
      "key": "subtitle",
      "column": "NewsSubTitle"
    },
    {
      "key": "summary",
      "field": "summary"
    },
    {
      "key": "body",
      "field": "body"
    },
    {
      "key": "alternate_title",
      "column": "AlternateNewsTitle"
    },
    {
      "key": "alternate_subtitle",
      "column": "AlternateNewsSubtitle"
    },
    {
      "key": "alternate_summary",
      "column": "AlternateNewsSummary"
    },
    {
      "key": "alternate_banner_caption",
      "column": "AlternateBannerCaption"
    },
    {
      "key": "pull_quote",
      "computed": "pull_quote"
    },
    {
      "key": "pull_quote_author",
      "field": "pull_quote_author"
    },
    {
      "key": "banner_caption",
      "column": "BannerCaption"
    },
    {
      "key": "medium_image_caption",
      "column": "MediumImageCaption"
    },
    {
      "key": "category",
      "decode": "taxonomy",
      "column": "Category"
    },
    {
      "key": "city",
      "decode": "taxonomy",
      "field": "city"
    },
    {
      "key": "entity",
      "decode": "taxonomy",
      "field": "entity"
    },
    {
      "key": "additional_entities",
      "decode": "entity_list",
      "field": "additional_entity"
    },
    {
      "key": "author",
      "decode": "ref",
      "column": "Author"
    },
    {
      "key": "publisher",
      "decode": "ref",
      "column": "Publisher"
    },
    {
      "key": "content_writer",
      "decode": "ref",
      "field": "author"
    },
    {
      "key": "content_approver",
      "decode": "ref",
      "column": "ContentApprover"
    },
    {
      "key": "editor",
      "decode": "ref",
      "column": "Editor"
    },
    {
      "key": "tags",
      "decode": "tags",
      "field": "tags"
    },
    {
      "key": "global_news",
      "column": "GlobalNews"
    },
    {
      "key": "locally_active",
      "column": "LocallyActive"
    },
    {
      "key": "globally_active",
      "column": "GloballyActive"
    },
    {
      "key": "local_approver_group",
      "field": "approver_group"
    },
    {
      "key": "global_approver_group",
      "column": "GlobalApproverGroup"
    },
    {
      "key": "is_published",
      "column": "IsPulished"
    },
    {
      "key": "is_globally_approved",
      "column": "IsGloballyApproved"
    },
    {
      "key": "is_locally_approved",
      "column": "IsLocallyApproved"
    },
    {
      "key": "is_modified_by_global",
      "column": "IsModifiedByGlobal"
    },
    {
      "key": "news_in_urdu",
      "decode": "urdu_link",
      "column": "NewsInUrdu"
    },
    {
      "key": "contact",
      "column": "Contact"
    },
    {
      "key": "secondary_language_2",
      "column": "SecondaryLanguage2"
    },
    {
      "key": "secondary_language_3",
      "column": "SecondaryLanguage3"
    },
    {
      "key": "schedule_start_date",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "key": "schedule_end_date",
      "column": "ScheduleEndDate"
    },
    {
      "key": "sequence_number",
      "field": "sequence_number"
    },
    {
      "key": "sharepoint_id",
      "computed": "sharepoint_id"
    },
    {
      "key": "sharepoint_sequence_number",
      "field": "sequence_number"
    },
    {
      "key": "sharepoint_modified",
      "column": "Modified"
    },
    {
      "key": "sharepoint_created",
      "column": "Created"
    }
  ]
}
